# users screen-alpine323 ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: User Management. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23. As$
# the VM: doas with wheel.conf's permit nopass :wheel; george,$
# uid 1001, and alpine, uid 1000, in wheel, "*", /bin/ash;$
# cloud-init's sudoers file written where no sudo reads it; sshd$
# without PAM.$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
$
# alpine -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
  [ ] SSH Keys             None$
   -  Password             None$
$
# george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure sudo, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

